# MagicCode Super-Resolution (prebuilt)

This directory ships a **closed-source** static library, public header, and
GPU parameter model so the video-call app can call MagicSR.

- `interface/mc_interface.h` — public API
- `lib/android/libmagic_sr.a`
- `lib/ios/libmagic_sr.a`
- `model/magic_sr_gpu_params.bin`

